						<div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
							<Badge>Octave</Badge>
							<Badge>Neural Networks</Badge>
							<Badge>Genetic Algorithm</Badge>
						</div>
						<a href="https://github.com/Atduyar/NeuroevolutionFlappyBird" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">
							github.com/Atduyar/NeuroevolutionFlappyBird
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="border border-[#90c5ff14] p-8 relative overflow-hidden group">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, #90c5ff08 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 20px 20px;"></div>
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
					<div class="relative">
						<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
							<h4 class="font-sinistre text-3xl text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Evrenomi</h4>
							<span class="font-oldturcic text-4xl opacity-20 text-gray-500 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-all duration-300">𐰼</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-base">Turkish social media blogging platform with mobile-responsive design, RESTful API architecture, user authentication, comment systems, and achieving 95+ Lighthouse performance scores.</p>
						<div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
